# Build context for the discord bot AND web images is the repo ROOT so they can COPY the shared/
# module — the bot imports it directly, and the web build needs it for Vite's envDir:'../' + the
# prebuild's shared Vaultwarden client. Send only what those images need — allowlist discord/ +
# web/ + shared/, drop the rest. (The .NET API image uses its own server/-scoped build, so this
# allowlist doesn't affect it.)
*
!discord
!web
!shared

# ...but never ship local build artifacts, even from the allowlisted dirs.
**/node_modules
**/coverage
**/dist
**/*.local
